## Third-Party Dependencies

This software includes the following third-party libraries, each with their own licenses:

### GLFW (https://github.com/glfw/glfw)
License: Zlib License
Used for: Window creation and input handling

### Yoga (https://github.com/facebook/yoga)
License: MIT License
Used for: Flexbox layout engine

### lexbor (https://github.com/lexbor/lexbor)
License: Apache 2.0
Used for: CSS parsing and selector matching

### stb_truetype (https://github.com/nothings/stb)
License: Public Domain / Unlicense
Used for: TrueType font rasterization and SDF generation

### Inter Font (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
License: OFL (Open Font License) 1.1
Used for: Default UI font (variable font instance)

### Space Mono Font (https://github.com/googlefonts/spacemono)
License: OFL (Open Font License) 1.1
Used for: Monospace UI font

See `third_party/` directory for individual license texts.
